---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import portrait from "../assets/profile.png";
import { profile } from "../data/profile";
import "../styles/portfolio.css";
---

<Layout title="About · Yeuanne Berry" description="The person behind the websites, applications, and Berry configuration.">
  <main id="main-content" class="shell about-page" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="about-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">A little about me</p><h1>Hi, I'm Yeuanne Berry.</h1><p class="portfolio-lede">I work on websites, applications,<br />and the systems around them.</p></div><Image src={portrait} alt="Yeuanne Berry" width={200} height={200} format="webp" class="about-portrait" /></div>
    <div class="about-body"><section><h2>Building through Yappers</h2><p>The featured projects here were delivered through Yappers. My work ranges from frontend implementation to complete applications. Each case study describes my contribution and credits branding and visual direction separately.</p><p>SoftlySang is a personal favorite: a website I created in full as a birthday gift for my mother.</p><a class="subtle-link" href="/work/">Read the project stories →</a></section><section><h2>Making room for Berry</h2><p>Berry is the configuration and set of tools I use around my Linux desktop. The guides explain the reusable pieces, the choices you can customize, and how to keep your own preferences separate.</p><a class="subtle-link" href="/docs/">Open the Berry guides →</a></section><section><h2>Find me elsewhere</h2><div class="about-links"><a href={profile.github}>GitHub ↗</a><a href={profile.studio}>Yappers ↗</a></div></section></div>
  </main>
</Layout>
